	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "XS4, 2-pin JST-XH, 2.5 mm pitch, colon leads to SEC. Housing measured 7.30 mm wide - wider than this board's 6.5 mm limit, but only the two THT pins land here; the housing itself overhangs the board edge with the cable exiting into open air, same as the mating half at SEC's own XS4. Pad 1 = raw +185V in, pad 2 = switched return to SEC's MPSA42 collector.")
